{"id": "34555", "title": "失恋期未满", "author": "岑扬", "category": "文学名著", "count": 43, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34555.htm", "intro": "是巧遇也是缘份--他和她是失恋的难友，倾诉彼此相似的伤痛。原该等伤痛过后擦去眼泪，彼此挥手告别，从此没有交集也不会重逢，但--尴尬！怎会又遇到她？而且，又是她哭肿双眼的悲情时刻！但，看到她的痴情，让他对于异性挽回了点信心。多想帮她和他一样也走出情伤，她的泪总让他心痛……他发现--自己的心在不知不觉中已跟随着她，连旁人都明白了他的心意，那她，是不是太……迟钝了？唉！看来她的失恋期未满，等--还有的等喽……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34555", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2191380.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2191381.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2191382.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2191383.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2191384.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2191385.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2191386.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2191387.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2191388.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2191389.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2191390.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2191391.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2191392.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2191393.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2191394.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2191395.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2191396.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2191397.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2191398.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2191399.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2191400.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2191401.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2191402.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2191403.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2191404.html", "available": fa